@startuml j2-safety-replies
!include style.iuml
title J2 Safety replies: emergency, discount or rule change, medical, not sure
actor Patient
participant "Chat page\n(index.html, chat.js)" as Chat
participant "core.js" as Core
database "localStorage" as LS
participant "WhatsApp" as WA
autonumber

Patient -> Chat : sends a question
Chat -> Core : FD.answer(q, data)
note right of Core
Fixed order: emergency, rule change or discount,
medical, booking, answer from the file, not sure.
The first rule that matches decides the reply.
end note
alt emergency (RX.emergency: facial swelling, bleeding that will not stop, breathing, broken jaw...)
  Core --> Chat : kind "emergency", status "urgent", T[lang].emergency(data)
  note right of Chat : "Call <emergency_phone> now. <emergency_rules> I have raised an urgent ticket so our team knows."
else rule change or discount (RX.injection or RX.discount)
  Core --> Chat : kind "refuse", status "answered", T[lang].refuse()
  note right of Chat : cannot change rules or prices, no discount; offers the listed prices, timings and doctors
else medical (RX.medical, unless it asks how to book)
  Core --> Chat : kind "medical", status "needs human", T[lang].medical(data)
  note right of Chat : no advice or diagnosis; a dentist must see you; phone, WhatsApp or a day and time for a call-back
else nothing in the file answers it
  Core --> Chat : kind "notsure", status "needs human", T[lang].notSure()
  note right of Chat
  Also when a price is asked for something the file does
  not price, or a named treatment (Invisalign, veneer,
  crown...) is not in the file.
  end note
end
note over Chat : modelOk is false, so askModel() returns null: no model call
Chat -> Core : FD.openNow(data), FD.addTicket(...)
Core -> LS : write frontdesk.tickets (callBack true when "needs human")
Chat -> Chat : ticketRows(t), with the label "Answered from the clinic file"\n(v1.6: not on a not-sure reply, which answers nothing from the file)
alt emergency
  Chat --> Patient : reply and a tel: button "Call <emergency_phone>"; no after-hours note
else refuse
  Chat --> Patient : reply only
else medical or not sure
  Chat --> Patient : reply, "Continue on WhatsApp", optional call-back form,\nafter-hours note when the clinic is closed
  opt Patient taps Continue on WhatsApp
    Patient -> WA : wa.me/91<whatsapp digits>?text=<the question>
  end
end
@enduml
